eed further assistance, please feel free to reach out.\n\nWe look forward to meeting you!\n\nYashi Mishra\nHR Department\nA Plus Digital Solutions\nMob : 8130550052\nEmail: hr@aplusdigitalsolutions.com\nWebsite : https://aplusdigitalsolutions.com','[\"CANDIDATE_NAME\",\"COMPANY_NAME\",\"INTERVIEW_DATE\",\"INTERVIEW_MODE\",\"candidate_name\",\"company_name\",\"interview_date\",\"interview_mode\"]','2026-06-12 10:10:36','General',NULL,0);
